    "commit": "662ffc2b",
    "summary": "s2 replaces the board's interim item list with six stage columns in workflow order. A pure board model (board-model.ts) filters the snapshot by scope, search and Needs attention, places each story and issue in the column of its daemon-assigned stage in snapshot order, counts before paging (show-more adds 50 per column) and builds text-labelled badges for approval, review, validation (including a failed story-level result), conflict, attention and notices. The host sends the 'board' message, keeps paging (reset by a filter change), logs unknown stages once per refresh and keeps the previous board when a render throws; the webview draws columns, cards and controls as plain text. Verification: npx tsc -p vscode-plugin exits 0; the plugin suite gives 865 pass and 2 fail, both pre-existing and failing without s2 (docs-review-panel t1 and manifest-catalog)."
